From ccaf4d46ea2988379f235d93bf0b7e5f6fd81fde Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ashutosh Chaubey <ashutoshchaubey2999@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 02:31:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] docs: point clone instructions to the official repository

Clone from https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness.git instead of
a personal fork, and note that agentic-evolution's setup script applies
the capabilities described under Repository context as patches on top of
a pinned upstream commit. Re-record the README translation-pairing hashes.
---
 README.i18n.yaml | 4 ++--
 README.md        | 6 ++++--
 README.zh.md     | 6 ++++--
 3 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/README.i18n.yaml b/README.i18n.yaml
index 9a838f7b5e..4638709ae1 100644
--- a/README.i18n.yaml
+++ b/README.i18n.yaml
@@ -2,5 +2,5 @@
 # side as of the last confirmed-consistent state. Both languages carry equal authority;
 # after editing either side, bring the other along and re-record with:
 #   pnpm run verify-translation-pairing --write README.md
-README.md: beb17ba208521c24e9619d758786fb1a32297614
-README.zh.md: 11f4226ff262223529f60b3552c8ed702b0cfef9
+README.md: 0e4a0a5e17cce66c6f324c73f6a137b912b93f6c
+README.zh.md: 1df7c5a13da8ebb9f05a583815bce5f259d7c9ea
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index beb17ba208..0e4a0a5e17 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -44,8 +44,8 @@ The command starts the Web UI at `http://127.0.0.1:3080` by default and opens it
 To run from a repository checkout:
 
 ```sh
-git clone git@github.com:t-aschaubey_microsoft/DSH-Attribution.git
-cd DSH-Attribution
+git clone https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness.git
+cd deepseek-harness
 pnpm install
 pnpm run build
 pnpm dsh web
@@ -53,6 +53,8 @@ pnpm dsh web
 
 `pnpm run build` prepares the repository artifacts. `pnpm dsh web` uses those built artifacts without rebuilding.
 
+The official repository does not include the capabilities listed under Repository context; agentic-evolution's setup script applies them as patches on top of a pinned upstream commit.
+
 ## Community and support
 
 - Submit feedback or bug reports through [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness/discussions).
diff --git a/README.zh.md b/README.zh.md
index 11f4226ff2..1df7c5a13d 100644
--- a/README.zh.md
+++ b/README.zh.md
@@ -48,8 +48,8 @@ npx @deepseek-ai/dsh web
 如需从仓库源码运行：
 
 ```sh
-git clone git@github.com:t-aschaubey_microsoft/DSH-Attribution.git
-cd DSH-Attribution
+git clone https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness.git
+cd deepseek-harness
 pnpm install
 pnpm run build
 pnpm dsh web
@@ -57,6 +57,8 @@ pnpm dsh web
 
 `pnpm run build` 会准备仓库产物。`pnpm dsh web` 会直接使用这些已构建产物，不会重新构建。
 
+官方仓库不包含“本仓库上下文”中列出的能力；agentic-evolution 的 setup 脚本会在固定的上游提交之上以补丁形式应用这些能力。
+
 ## 社区与支持
 
 - 通过 [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness/discussions) 提交反馈或 bug 报告。
